    <description>
        <en>A placeable Fertilizer Depot where you can buy, store, and sell all fertilizer types at
seasonally-adjusted prices. Drive up with your trailer or tank, browse the full selection of
fertilizers, and fill up directly from depot storage. Works seamlessly with FS25_SoilFertilizer â”œÂ»â”¬â”â”¬Â¢â”œÂ»â”¬â”â”¬Â¢â”œÂ»â”¬â”â”¬Â¢
all 23+ custom fill types are automatically available. Falls back to vanilla fertilizer types if
SoilFertilizer is not installed.

Features:
- Buy all SF fertilizer types at seasonal prices
- Per-type silo storage (50,000L per fill type)
- Sell excess fertilizer back at 80% of buy price
- Seasonal price fluctuation (Spring +15%, Winter -15%)
- Full multiplayer support with server-authoritative transactions
- FarmTablet integration via g_DepotManager global
